  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "when I launch vrchat, things go ok, the loading screen doesn't go in a loop and goes pretty fast, but when I actually get in the game (home) my screen fades to black, I could still hear music, but couldn't see. I thought it was just my vr, so I tested another vr game to see if it did the same thing, but it worked fine. when you see this PLEASE fix this as soon as you can, I can't play, and this is one of my favorite games!!!\n\nedit: after the update, I still have the same problem. I'm not sure if it's just my computer or not, but I still can't play the game because of this.",
